    {
      "text": "Press **▶ Play**, then play the **Z** to **M** keys. Each key sends the oscillator a pitch and the envelope a gate.",
      "position": [
        16.0,
        666.0
      ],
      "width": 300.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The envelope draws each note's shape: up when a key goes down, away when it's let go. The VCA turns that shape into volume.",
